    </div>
    <figcaption>The shared shop / storage skeleton at the game's native <strong>1280 × 720 (16:9)</strong>. Every shop fills these regions; only the tab set, the list contents, and the detail differ. The storage counter uses the same layout (its tabs are Deposit / Withdraw · Items / Meseta).</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <style>
    /* Native game frame: fixed 16:9 at 1280×720, scaling down to fit while
       keeping the ratio. cq units (relative to the frame's size) make every
